Modifications relative to the upstream code (Apache 2.0 §4):

  1. Removed six direct API providers (Gemini, OpenAI, Azure, X.AI, DIAL,
     Custom) and the corresponding catalogue JSONs, environment variables,
     and tests. Mesh routes only through the `gemini` CLI, the `codex` CLI,
     and OpenRouter.
  2. Renamed the project from "pal" / "PAL MCP Server" to "Mesh MCP Server".
  3. Rewrote the CLI provider implementations (providers/gemini_cli.py and
     providers/codex_cli.py) to invoke the real `gemini -p ... -o json` and
     `codex exec --json` shapes — the upstream invented schemas did not
     match the actual CLI binaries.
  4. Removed Docker tooling, PowerShell duplicates, and the
     `code_quality_checks.sh` / `.pre-commit-config.yaml` developer scripts.
  5. Bumped minimum Python from 3.10 to 3.11 and modernised typing syntax
     across the codebase.

